net","category":"デバッグとVBAとの違い","term":"ブレークポイント / F5, F10, F11","summary":"停止位置／実行／ステップオーバー／ステップイン。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0124"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"デバッグとVBAとの違い","term":"VBA との違い","summary":"VB.NET は型の厳密さ、クラスの機能、非同期処理などが強化された言語で、VBA とは別物です。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0125"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"デバッグとVBAとの違い","term":"VB6 からの移行","summary":"構文は似ていますが、言語・ライブラリが大きく変わりました。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0126"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Dim","summary":"変数を宣言する。","examples":[{"code":"Dim n As Integer = 10","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0127"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Static (変数)","summary":"プロシージャを抜けても値を覚えている変数。","examples":[{"code":"Static count As Integer","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0128"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Option Compare Text","summary":"文字列の比較で大文字小文字を区別しない設定。","examples":[{"code":"Option Compare Text","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0129"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Region / End Region","summary":"コードを折りたたみできるグループにする。","examples":[{"code":"#Region \"初期化\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0130"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Debug.WriteLine","summary":"出力ウィンドウにデバッグ用の文字を表示する。","examples":[{"code":"Debug.WriteLine(\"値=\" & n)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0131"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Environment.NewLine","summary":"改行の文字を返す。","examples":[{"code":"s = \"A\" & Environment.NewLine & \"B\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0132"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"vbCrLf / vbTab","summary":"改行・タブを表す定数。","examples":[{"code":"s = \"A\" & vbCrLf & \"B\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0133"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"My.Computer","summary":"コンピュータの情報や機能にかんたんにアクセスする。","examples":[{"code":"My.Computer.Clipboard.SetText(\"hi\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0134"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"My.Application","summary":"アプリケーションの情報を取得する。","examples":[{"code":"My.Application.Info.Version","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0135"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Application.Exit","summary":"アプリケーションを終了する。","examples":[{"code":"Application.Exit()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0136"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Environment.GetCommandLineArgs","summary":"コマンドライン引数を取得する。","examples":[{"code":"Dim args = Environment.GetCommandLineArgs()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0137"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"GoTo とラベル","summary":"指定したラベルへ移動する。使いすぎは避ける。","examples":[{"code":"GoTo Done","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0138"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"Stop 文","summary":"デバッグ中にそこで実行を止める。","examples":[{"code":"Stop","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0139"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"基本","term":"End 文","summary":"処理を直ちに終了する。","examples":[{"code":"End","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0140"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Short / UShort","summary":"16ビットの整数型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim s As Short = 100","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0141"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"UInteger / ULong","summary":"負の数を持たない整数型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim u As UInteger = 5UI","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0142"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Byte / SByte","summary":"8ビットの整数型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim b As Byte = 255","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0143"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Single","summary":"単精度の浮動小数点型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim f As Single = 1.5F","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0144"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"TimeSpan","summary":"時間の長さを表す型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim t As New TimeSpan(1, 30, 0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0145"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"DateTimeOffset","summary":"UTC との差を含めた日時型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim d = DateTimeOffset.Now","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0146"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Guid","summary":"世界で一意な ID を表す型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim g = Guid.NewGuid()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0147"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Tuple (タプル)","summary":"複数の値をまとめて返す。","examples":[{"code":"Dim t = (1, \"a\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0148"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"名前付きタプル","summary":"要素に名前を付けたタプル。","examples":[{"code":"Dim p As (Id As Integer, Name As String) = (1, \"A\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0149"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"BigInteger","summary":"桁数に制限のない整数型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim b As System.Numerics.BigInteger = 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0150"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Type 型 (GetType)","summary":"型の情報を取得する。","examples":[{"code":"Dim t = GetType(String)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0151"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"TypeOf ... Is","summary":"オブジェクトが指定の型かどうか調べる。","examples":[{"code":"If TypeOf o Is String Then","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0152"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"DirectCast / CType / TryCast","summary":"オブジェクトの型を変換する。TryCast は失敗で Nothing。","examples":[{"code":"Dim s = TryCast(o, String)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0153"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Option Strict と暗黙の型変換","summary":"暗黙の型変換を禁止し、バグを防ぐ。","examples":[{"code":"Option Strict On","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0154"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"Char の判定 (Char.IsDigit)","summary":"文字の種類を調べる。","examples":[{"code":"Char.IsDigit(\"5\"c)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0155"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"文字リテラル \"a\"c","summary":"1文字を表すリテラル。","examples":[{"code":"Dim c As Char = \"a\"c","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0156"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"16進・2進リテラル","summary":"&H や &B で数を表す。","examples":[{"code":"Dim n = &HFF","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0157"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"データ型","term":"型推論 (Dim x = ...)","summary":"値から型を自動で決める。","examples":[{"code":"Dim x = 10","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0158"},{"lang":"vbne