,"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0204"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"<< >>","summary":"ビットをずらす。","examples":[{"code":"n << 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0205"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"TypeOf ... IsNot","summary":"型でないことを調べる。","examples":[{"code":"If TypeOf o IsNot String Then","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0206"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"AddressOf","summary":"プロシージャのアドレス（デリゲート）を渡す。","examples":[{"code":"AddHandler btn.Click, AddressOf OnClick","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0207"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"NameOf","summary":"変数や型の名前を文字列で取得する。","examples":[{"code":"NameOf(name)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0208"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"? (Null 条件)","summary":"null のときは評価せず Nothing を返す。","examples":[{"code":"Dim n = s?.Length","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0209"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"\\ 整数除算","summary":"商の整数部分を返す。","examples":[{"code":"7 \\ 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0210"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"演算子","term":"演算子の優先順位","summary":"計算の順番のルール。迷ったら括弧を使う。","examples":[{"code":"(a + b) * c","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0211"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"構造体 (Structure) と クラスの違い","summary":"構造体は値型、クラスは参照型。","examples":[{"code":"Structure P : Public X As Integer : End Structure","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0212"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"コンストラクタ チェーン","summary":"別のコンストラクタを呼び出す。","examples":[{"code":"Me.New(0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0213"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Finalize / Dispose","summary":"後始末の処理。IDisposable を実装する。","examples":[{"code":"Implements IDisposable","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0214"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"NotInheritable","summary":"継承できないクラスにする。","examples":[{"code":"NotInheritable Class A","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0215"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Protected","summary":"派生クラスからのみアクセスできる。","examples":[{"code":"Protected Sub M()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0216"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Friend","summary":"同じアセンブリ内からだけアクセスできる。","examples":[{"code":"Friend Class A","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0217"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"自動実装プロパティ","summary":"本体を書かずにプロパティを作る。","examples":[{"code":"Public Property Name As String","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0218"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"ReadOnly Property","summary":"読み取り専用のプロパティ。","examples":[{"code":"Public ReadOnly Property Id As Integer","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0219"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"既定のプロパティ (Default)","summary":"添字でアクセスできるプロパティ。","examples":[{"code":"Default Public ReadOnly Property Item(i As Integer) As String","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0220"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Shared コンストラクタ","summary":"クラスを最初に使うときに1回だけ動く。","examples":[{"code":"Shared Sub New()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0221"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"オブジェクト初期化子","summary":"作成と同時にプロパティを設定する。","examples":[{"code":"Dim p As New Person With {.Name = \"A\"}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0222"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"コレクション初期化子","summary":"作成と同時に要素を追加する。","examples":[{"code":"Dim l As New List(Of Integer) From {1, 2, 3}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0223"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"ToString のオーバーライド","summary":"文字列表現を決める。","examples":[{"code":"Public Overrides Function ToString() As String","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0224"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Equals / GetHashCode","summary":"等しいかの判定を決める。","examples":[{"code":"Public Overrides Function Equals(o As Object) As Boolean","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0225"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"IComparable / IComparer","summary":"並べ替えの基準を決める。","examples":[{"code":"Implements IComparable(Of P)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0226"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"IEnumerable の実装","summary":"For Each で回せるクラスにする。","examples":[{"code":"Implements IEnumerable(Of T)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0227"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Iterator / Yield","summary":"値を1つずつ返すメソッドを作る。","examples":[{"code":"Iterator Function F() As IEnumerable(Of Integer)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0228"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"デリゲート (Delegate)","summary":"メソッドを変数のように扱う型。","examples":[{"code":"Delegate Sub Notify(msg As String)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0229"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"Action / Func","summary":"標準のデリゲート型。","examples":[{"code":"Dim f As Func(Of Integer, Integer) = Function(x) x * 2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0230"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"属性 (Attribute)","summary":"クラスやメソッドに付ける追加の情報。","examples":[{"code":"<Obsolete> Sub Old()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0231"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"リフレクション","summary":"実行中に型やメンバーの情報を調べる。","examples":[{"code":"GetType(String).GetMethods()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0232"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"共変性・反変性","summary":"ジェネリックの型の代入ルール。","examples":[{"code":"IEnumerable(Of Object)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0233"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"演算子のオーバーロード","summary":"+ などの演算子の動きを自作する。","examples":[{"code":"Public Shared Operator +(a As V, b As V) As V","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0234"},{"lang":"vbnet","category":"クラス","term":"部分メソッド","summary":"Partial クラスの中で宣言だけするメソッド。","examples":[{"code":"Partial Private Sub OnLoad()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"vbnet-0235"}]}